    },
    "Hold a key on its own, speak, and let go. fn (Globe) is at the bottom left of a MacBook keyboard. Right Control suits most external keyboards." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单独按住一个键，说话，然后松开。fn（地球仪）键在 MacBook 键盘的左下角，外接键盘大多适合用右侧 Control 键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold a key, speak, and let go. Orra types what you said into the app you are using. Your voice is turned into text on this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住一个键，说话，然后松开。Orra 会把你说的话输入到你正在使用的 App 中。语音在这台 Mac 上转成文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Orra %@…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安装 Orra %@…"
