            "value" : "源代码和隐私说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Speech is turned into text on this Mac. Orra goes online only to download the speech model when you ask it to, and to check for updates when you allow it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音在这台 Mac 上转成文字。Orra 只在两种情况下联网：你要求下载语音模型时，以及你允许后检查更新时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
